e_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1502044-pugmire-2nd-edition-character-sheets?p=1502046#post1502046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Gone, using direct link I got:<br /> <i>' <b>Not Found</b><br /> <br /> The requested URL was not found on this server.<br /> <br /> Additionally, a 404 Not Found error was encountered while trying to use an ErrorDocument to handle the request.' <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Something weird happened the link here, but I think I have it fixed now.<br /> <br /> Thanks for letting me know.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1502044-pugmire-2nd-edition-character-sheets?p=1502047#post1502047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looking over 2E Playtest sheet from Misc category...<br /> <br /> Why Defense have two numbers? \ud83e\udd14<br /> EDIT: Got answer on Defense question on RoP FB group - Two numbers are for with and without shield. \ud83d\ude32</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, cool. Glad you worked it out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedb